<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>entrosana hub — in the making</title>
<meta name="description" content="The entrosana Hub is being built: theory and practice developed together, in the open.">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<meta property="og:title" content="entrosana hub — in the making">
<meta property="og:description" content="Theory and practice developed together, in the open.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://entrosana.app/">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'><circle cx='16' cy='16' r='13' fill='none' stroke='%232BD4E8' stroke-width='2.5'/><path d='M16 9a7 7 0 100 14 5 5 0 110-10 3 3 0 100 6' fill='none' stroke='%232BD4E8' stroke-width='2.5'/></svg>">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#1B1E24; --paper-2:#22262E; --ink:#E9EBE7; --ink-2:#C6CAD1;
    --muted:#8F95A1; --line:#323843; --seal:#2BD4E8; --seal-2:#7FE7F3;
    --mono: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "Cascadia Mono", "Roboto Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    --sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  *,*::before,*::after{ box-sizing:border-box }
  html,body{ margin:0; padding:0 }
  body{
    background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--sans);
    line-height:1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    min-height:100dvh; display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(120ch 60ch at 50% -10%, rgba(43,212,232,.10), transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #1E2229 0%, var(--paper) 45%);
  }
  .wrap{ width:min(72ch, calc(100% - 3rem)); margin-inline:auto }
  header{ padding:2rem 0 }
  .brand{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.6rem; text-decoration:none; color:inherit }
  .brand svg{ width:26px; height:26px; display:block }
  .brand span{ font-size:1.15rem; letter-spacing:.01em; color:var(--seal) }
  main{ flex:1; display:flex; align-items:center; padding:2rem 0 4rem }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.8rem; letter-spacing:.16em;
    text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--seal); margin:0 0 1.1rem;
  }
  h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.1rem, 6vw, 3.4rem); line-height:1.08; margin:0 0 1.4rem;
    font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-.02em;
  }
  .lead{ font-size:1.12rem; color:var(--ink-2); margin:0 0 1rem; max-width:58ch }
  p{ margin:0 0 1rem }
  .rule{
    height:1px; border:0; margin:2.2rem 0;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(43,212,232,.45) 20%, rgba(43,212,232,.45) 80%, transparent);
  }
  h2{ font-size:1.45rem; margin:0 0 .35rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-.01em }
  .sub{ color:var(--muted); margin:0 0 1.4rem }
  .grid{ display:grid; gap:1rem; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr)) }
  .card{
    border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; padding:1.1rem 1.15rem;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--paper-2), rgba(34,38,46,.55));
  }
  .card__head{ display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:.6rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:.5rem }
  .card h3{ font-size:1.05rem; margin:0; font-weight:600 }
  .chip{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.68rem; letter-spacing:.09em; text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:.16rem .5rem; border-radius:999px; white-space:nowrap;
    border:1px solid rgba(43,212,232,.4); color:var(--seal);
  }
  .chip--plan{ border-color:var(--line); color:var(--muted) }
  .card .who{
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.78rem; color:var(--seal-2);
    opacity:.85; margin:0 0 .6rem;
  }
  .card p{ margin:0; color:var(--ink-2); font-size:.95rem }
  .actions{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.75rem; margin-top:2rem }
  .btn{
    display:inline-block; padding:.62rem 1.15rem; border-radius:999px;
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.9rem; text-decoration:none;
    border:1px solid var(--seal); color:var(--seal); transition:background .15s, color .15s;
  }
  .btn:hover{ background:var(--seal); color:#071316 }
  .btn--ghost{ border-color:var(--line); color:var(--ink-2) }
  .btn--ghost:hover{ background:transparent; border-color:var(--seal); color:var(--seal) }
  footer{
    border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:1.4rem 0 2.4rem;
    font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.82rem; color:var(--muted);
  }
  footer a{ color:var(--muted) }
  footer a:hover{ color:var(--seal) }
  .dot{ opacity:.5; padding:0 .5rem }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){
    main > .wrap{ animation:rise .5s ease-out both }
    @keyframes rise{ from{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px) } to{ opacity:1; transform:none } }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="https://entrosana.com/">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="13" fill="none" stroke="#2BD4E8" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <path d="M16 9a7 7 0 100 14 5 5 0 110-10 3 3 0 100 6" fill="none" stroke="#2BD4E8" stroke-width="2.5"/>
      </svg>
      <span>entrosana</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Hub · in the making</p>
    <h1>We are building the&nbsp;Hub.</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      A place where students, parents, teachers and outside experts develop
      auditable tools together — and learn how the machines they use actually work.
    </p>

    <hr class="rule">

    <h2>Module areas</h2>
    <p class="sub">Human-led lessons, adapted to the school and the age group.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card__head"><h3>Social</h3><span class="chip">on request</span></div>
        <p class="who">social work driven · social skills · community building</p>
        <p>How we create values, talk, decide, and live together or alone, including
           how to read the media, the machines and influences around us.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card__head"><h3>Nature-based</h3><span class="chip">on request</span></div>
        <p class="who">nature driven · ecology · outdoor learning</p>
        <p>Out of the classroom and into the forest, with experiences that revitalize
           mind and body.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card__head"><h3>Technical</h3><span class="chip">on request</span></div>
        <p class="who">code · computing · datafeatures</p>
        <p>How software, data and machines actually work and can be used productively,
           taught in different depths.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <hr class="rule">

    <h2>Tools</h2>
    <p class="sub">Back-office work that carries its own record. Status as of today.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card__head"><h3>Accounting</h3><span class="chip">in development</span></div>
        <p class="who">for administrative responsabilities and process efficiency</p>
        <p>Routine bookings, bank reconciliation, recurring invoices and document filing.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card__head"><h3>HR &amp; payroll</h3><span class="chip">in development</span></div>
        <p class="who">for payroll runs, contracts, and attestations</p>
        <p>Payroll preparation, contract drafts and employment attestations, with every
           figure traceable to its source.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card__head"><h3>Consulting</h3><span class="chip chip--plan">planned</span></div>
        <p class="who">for second opinions that show their work</p>
        <p>Structured analyses and reviews delivered with the decision path, so a
           recommendation can be traced.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <hr class="rule">

    <p>
      Nothing above is finished. The labels say where each piece actually stands, and
      they change as the work does. Everything we can already show is on the main site,
      and the source is public.
    </p>

    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn" href="https://entrosana.com/hub/">What the Hub will be</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="https://entrosana.com/modules/">All modules</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="https://github.com/entrosana/hub">Source code</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    entrosana <span class="dot">·</span>
    <a href="https://entrosana.com/imprint/">Imprint</a> <span class="dot">·</span>
    <a href="https://entrosana.com/privacy/">Privacy</a> <span class="dot">·</span>
    Open source · AGPL-3.0
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
